    },
    "message": "⚠️ This package is deprecated\n\nSuperseded by modernized versions supporting Azure Functions v4 and .NET 6/8.\n\nMigrate to:\n- In-Process: Extensions.Azure.WebJobs.SQS (https://www.nuget.org/packages/Extensions.Azure.WebJobs.SQS)\n- Isolated Worker (Recommended): Extensions.Azure.Functions.Worker.SQS (https://www.nuget.org/packages/Extensions.Azure.Functions.Worker.SQS)\n\nImportant: Microsoft ends in-process model support on Nov 10, 2026 (https://aka.ms/azure-functions-retirements/in-process-model). Migrate to isolated worker.\n\nMigration Guide: https://github.com/laveeshb/azure-functions-sqs-extension/blob/main/dotnet/MIGRATION_GUIDE.md\n\nWhat's New:\n- Azure Functions v4 runtime\n- .NET 6/8 multi-targeting\n- Modern AWS SDK integration\n- LocalStack support\n\nIssues/Questions: https://github.com/laveeshb/azure-functions-sqs-extension",
    "reasons": [
      "Legacy"
    ]
  },
